1
00:15:58,929 --> 00:16:04,341
No, no, I don't think so, but I think
it's something should be looked into.

2
00:16:11,249 --> 00:16:13,536
Now, who chucked him down here?

3
00:16:13,732 --> 00:16:15,752
The wind, I hope.

4
00:16:16,460 --> 00:16:18,752
There must be a window open up there.

5
00:16:19,536 --> 00:16:24,028
No Lizzie, let him
lay. Let him sleep it off.

6
00:16:24,722 --> 00:16:28,190
I hope the power lines don't
go down, put the lights out.

7
00:16:29,048 --> 00:16:31,234
We'll check the windows
in the living room...

8
00:16:31,264 --> 00:16:33,571
and drawn the curtains
and then we'll go to bed.

9
00:16:33,601 --> 00:16:34,807
Yes, ma'am.

10
00:16:44,285 --> 00:16:45,717
I won't be a minute.

11
00:16:52,602 --> 00:16:54,004
Miss Corny...

12
00:16:55,512 --> 00:16:56,476
What was that?

13
00:16:57,034 --> 00:17:01,966
Oh, when I went to get the
paper, I turned the latch off.

14
00:17:01,996 --> 00:17:04,436
I forgot to turn it on again.

15
00:17:05,024 --> 00:17:08,297
He's out there, he was coming in.

16
00:17:08,855 --> 00:17:10,152
He might've got you.

17
00:17:10,182 --> 00:17:13,861
Oh, but he didn't and
he's still out there, thanks to you.

18
00:17:13,891 --> 00:17:16,062
Now, you hurry now
go we'll call the police.

19
00:17:16,092 --> 00:17:18,912
No, no, I won't leave you Miss Corny.

20
00:17:18,942 --> 00:17:24,641
- Are you Ok?
- Yes ma'am, I'm, I'm ok.

21
00:17:24,898 --> 00:17:25,968
Ok.

22
00:17:34,802 --> 00:17:37,486
- Operator.
- Give me the police department please.

23
00:17:38,368 --> 00:17:41,880
- Zenith police department.
- This is Cornelia Van Gorder.

24
00:17:41,910 --> 00:17:45,378
- I'm living at the Oaks.
- We know about that Miss Van Gorder.

25
00:17:45,408 --> 00:17:50,036
Just a moment ago, a man
tried to force his way into this house.

26
00:17:50,066 --> 00:17:52,658
You're not alone there, are you?
What about your servants?

27
00:17:52,688 --> 00:17:57,468
Well, I have none except my chauffeur and
he's away, won't be back until the morning.

28
00:17:57,498 --> 00:18:01,748
Now, there's only two of us here tonight
and we're going to lock ourselves in my room.

29
00:18:02,005 --> 00:18:07,251
Now, if, if any of your men see
anything, will you have them call me?

30
00:18:07,281 --> 00:18:10,778
- I'll send officers over there right away.
- Well, thank you very much.

31
00:18:12,391 --> 00:18:14,864
Come on Lizzie, we're
going to sleep in my room.

32
00:18:25,145 --> 00:18:30,426
Well, nothing can get at us in
this room now, I don't think.

33
00:18:30,625 --> 00:18:34,979
- This door seems good and solid.
- Like the door to a tomb.

34
00:18:45,307 --> 00:18:49,317
I think that couch will be comfortable,
it's some extra bedding you know...

35
00:18:49,347 --> 00:18:50,734
- in the closet.
- Yes, ma'am.

36
00:18:51,745 --> 00:18:52,966
Let's see now.

37
00:19:06,669 --> 00:19:09,593
No bolt, no that's not so good.

38
00:19:17,900 --> 00:19:22,121
- Ma'am, what's that for?
- That my good woman, is a boobie trap.

39
00:19:23,086 --> 00:19:28,000
If anybody tries to open this transom this'll
be knocked off, and we'll hear it fall..

40
00:20:01,242 --> 00:20:06,986
Oh, fiddlesticks, I forgot my night things,
my robe, my gown and my sleepers.

41
00:20:07,212 --> 00:20:10,408
- I'll go get them now.
- Now, wait a minute, Lizzie.

42
00:20:10,694 --> 00:20:13,966
- I'll go with you...
- Now don't you bother Miss Cornelia.

43
00:20:13,996 --> 00:20:17,042
- My room is just down the hall.
- Lizzie, I told you to wait!

44
00:20:17,946 --> 00:20:20,147
It's all right, I'll only be a second.

45
00:20:22,959 --> 00:20:23,208
Get in here!

46
00:20:23,418 --> 00:20:25,210
Get in here!

47
00:20:35,465 --> 00:20:37,139
- Yes?
- Miss Van Gorder?

48
00:20:37,320 --> 00:20:39,460
- Yes?
- Zenith police department.

49
00:20:39,928 --> 00:20:41,872
There's a police car
just outside your house.

50
00:20:41,902 --> 00:20:43,891
And the officers in
it have reported that there's...

51
00:20:43,921 --> 00:20:46,349
no sign of a prowler
anywhere on the grounds.
